<title>USA: TABLE - Danaher Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Danaher Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.64		    $0.54</p>
<p> Net			 38,528		   32,525</p>
<p> Revs		     502,789		  434,897</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  60,029		   59,932</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.16		    $0.99</p>
<p> Oper net		  69,793		   59,453</p>
<p> Revs		     969,230		  844,454</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  60,204		   59,806</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 EPS rose 19 percent, sales rose 16 percent.</p>
<p>Year-ago six-month earnings exclude $79.8 million from discontinued operations. Including these operations, net earnings were $139.3 million, or $2.33 a share.</p>
